
This directory contains header files for the 0x3 ESP Project.

Header files included:
- config.h: Project configuration constants and settings
- system_manager.h: System management and status handling
- wifi_manager.h: WiFi connection and configuration management
- web_server.h: Web server and API endpoint handling  
- ota_handler.h: Over-the-air update functionality

Each header file defines the interface for its corresponding implementation
in the src/ directory. This modular approach ensures clean separation of
concerns and maintainable code structure.

The config.h file contains all project-wide constants that can be easily
modified to customize the behavior of the system without changing the
core implementation code.

For more information about the 0x3 ESP Project, see the main README.md file.
